        DP Indirect Long Indexed, Y      ($17 - 2 bytes, 6 cycles¹²)
        Stack Relative (also SR)         ($03 - 2 bytes, 4 cycles¹)
        SR Indirect Indexed, Y           ($13 - 2 bytes, 7 cycles¹)
