	specify the lo/hi bytes separately:
	":gc #INC_ABS; adrs+0,x; adrs+1,x" =>
	lda #INC_ABS
	sta target,y
	lda adrs+0,x
	sta target+1,y
	lda adrs+1,x
	sta target+2,y
	If more advanced methods of calculating bytes are needed, they can be generated one at a time, like:
	:gc #LDA_IMM
	lda something
	ora somethingElse
	:gc //no args = output accumulator
	Another one...
	:gc #STA_ABS
